            <pubDate>Fri, 01 Dec 2023 00:01:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[这是古往今来的个人历报，辑录着个人的工作情况与历程]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-note admonition_xJq3 alert alert--secondary"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.3 5.69a.942.942 0 0 1-.28-.7c0-.28.09-.52.28-.7.19-.18.42-.28.7-.28.28 0 .52.09.7.28.18.19.28.42.28.7 0 .28-.09.52-.28.7a1 1 0 0 1-.7.3c-.28 0-.52-.11-.7-.3zM8 7.99c-.02-.25-.11-.48-.31-.69-.2-.19-.42-.3-.69-.31H6c-.27.02-.48.13-.69.31-.2.2-.3.44-.31.69h1v3c.02.27.11.5.31.69.2.2.42.31.69.31h1c.27 0 .48-.11.69-.31.2-.19.3-.42.31-.69H8V7.98v.01zM7 2.3c-3.14 0-5.7 2.54-5.7 5.68 0 3.14 2.56 5.7 5.7 5.7s5.7-2.55 5.7-5.7c0-3.15-2.56-5.69-5.7-5.69v.01zM7 .98c3.86 0 7 3.14 7 7s-3.14 7-7 7-7-3.12-7-7 3.14-7 7-7z"></path></svg></span>备注</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><p>这是古往今来的个人历报，辑录着个人的工作情况与历程</p></div></div>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="写在前面">写在前面<a href="http://ydsuper.github.io/snotes/report/%E5%8E%86%E6%8A%A5#%E5%86%99%E5%9C%A8%E5%89%8D%E9%9D%A2" class="hash-link" aria-label="写在前面的直接链接" title="写在前面的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<p>下面会记录个人的日报或者周报情况，不一定全面详细，但会体现个人一直以来的工作情况，重点突出个人历程的记录，方便回顾复盘，愿与君共勉！</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="序文">序文<a href="http://ydsuper.github.io/snotes/report/%E5%8E%86%E6%8A%A5#%E5%BA%8F%E6%96%87" class="hash-link" aria-label="序文的直接链接" title="序文的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-info admonition_xJq3 alert alert--info"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7 2.3c3.14 0 5.7 2.56 5.7 5.7s-2.56 5.7-5.7 5.7A5.71 5.71 0 0 1 1.3 8c0-3.14 2.56-5.7 5.7-5.7zM7 1C3.14 1 0 4.14 0 8s3.14 7 7 7 7-3.14 7-7-3.14-7-7-7zm1 3H6v5h2V4zm0 6H6v2h2v-2z"></path></svg></span>有感</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><p>寒窗苦读十余载，厚积薄发载(zài)登云</p></div></div>
<p>离校后，遂寻工作，入职叠纸，自 2022 年 7 月 22 日后，1年后转嵌入式，善哉！</p>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-tip admonition_xJq3 alert alert--success"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.5 0C3.48 0 1 2.19 1 5c0 .92.55 2.25 1 3 1.34 2.25 1.78 2.78 2 4v1h5v-1c.22-1.22.66-1.75 2-4 .45-.75 1-2.08 1-3 0-2.81-2.48-5-5.5-5zm3.64 7.48c-.25.44-.47.8-.67 1.11-.86 1.41-1.25 2.06-1.45 3.23-.02.05-.02.11-.02.17H5c0-.06 0-.13-.02-.17-.2-1.17-.59-1.83-1.45-3.23-.2-.31-.42-.67-.67-1.11C2.44 6.78 2 5.65 2 5c0-2.2 2.02-4 4.5-4 1.22 0 2.36.42 3.22 1.19C10.55 2.94 11 3.94 11 5c0 .66-.44 1.78-.86 2.48zM4 14h5c-.23 1.14-1.3 2-2.5 2s-2.27-.86-2.5-2z"></path></svg></span>云诗</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><font size="4"><b>复思觅路，盼磐实</b></font><br><p>忙忙碌碌慰几何，辗辗转转坐百班。<br>
不劳不惑惟心愁，生郁深闷若木鸡。<br>
推文甩墨不解燥，劝君思去莫复还。<br>
求得绪果释重石，徐徐散尽悟历己。</p><p>             —— 益达SUPER</p></div></div>]]></content:encoded>
